<section class="sec" id="why">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">Why now</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">Why AI-first digital marketing, and <span class="serif">why now.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">Every business in India is fighting for attention online, and AI has rewritten how that fight is won. Marketers who can run paid ads, rank content and drive AI tools are hired faster and paid better than ever, while template marketers fall behind.</p>
<div class="why-stats">
<div class="ws reveal"><b>900M+</b><span class="t">Indians online</span><p>The largest digital audience on earth, and every brand needs someone to reach it.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>60%</b><span class="t">Of tasks now AI-assisted</span><p>Campaign copy, creatives and reporting run on AI. We teach the workflows, not just the tools.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>2x</b><span class="t">Demand for performance skills</span><p>Performance marketers who prove ROI are the most recruited marketing profile.</p></div>
</div>
<h3 class="reveal" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:44px">Why it is a smart move for you</h3>
<div class="diff-grid" style="margin-top:22px">
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-cap"></use></svg></span><b>Any degree works</b><p>Commerce, arts, science or engineering: marketing rewards clear thinking, not a specific syllabus.</p></div>
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-chart"></use></svg></span><b>Client-ready in months</b><p>You run real ad budgets in class, so your portfolio shows spend managed, not just theory.</p></div>
