<details><summary>What is the starting salary in digital marketing in India? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Executives typically start between Rs 3 and 5 lakh. Performance specialists with proven ROI reach Rs 9 to 15 lakh within a few years, and freelancers set their own ceiling.</div></details>
<details><summary>Has AI killed digital marketing jobs? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">It killed template marketing. Companies now want marketers who direct AI: strategy, testing and judgement. That is exactly what this AI-first course trains, from the first week.</div></details>
